        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2013. Published by Elsevier Masson SAS.",
        "AbstractText": "Torsion of the greater omentum is a rare cause of acute abdominal pain. The symptoms of this pathology are non-specific and abdominal CT is usually necessary to make the diagnosis. Treatment is surgical and can often be performed laparoscopically."
